    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world has been overrun by Plushes</strong><br>Yes, that\u2019s right\u00a0<strong>\u2013</strong> plushy creatures. Cute, soft and completely insane!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a</strong> <strong>Plush Fighter</strong><br>A young hero with a gun and a shovel.\u00a0Save Moscow from the disaster and find your sister!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a city full of mysteries, use the Plushes themselves as weapons, resources, and tools, steal powers from bosses, and unlock access to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight, adapt!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cute, but Deadly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Plush has its own logic and behavior. Study them and turn their features to your advantage! They scream, jump, roll, shove, spit, explode, and cause you endless trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t trust those adorable button eyes<strong>. </strong>Plushes have already destroyed half the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/bce5b3a5c0a16c4f7050ac63377ad8cc.poster.avif?t=1755248884\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/bce5b3a5c0a16c4f7050ac63377ad8cc.webm?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/bce5b3a5c0a16c4f7050ac63377ad8cc.mp4?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enemy\u2019s Power Is Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses and claim their abilities. Summon giant Plushes as allies in battle. Freeze, burn, crush!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/4ef1c4faf4e46be642f5f63e9a4b86ae.poster.avif?t=1755248884\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/4ef1c4faf4e46be642f5f63e9a4b86ae.webm?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/4ef1c4faf4e46be642f5f63e9a4b86ae.mp4?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plush as a Tool</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use enemy powers to break barriers and reach hidden areas on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/2cc7b2941a937474bd9dca7655b818d2.poster.avif?t=1755248884\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/2cc7b2941a937474bd9dca7655b818d2.webm?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/2cc7b2941a937474bd9dca7655b818d2.mp4?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story on the Edge of Trash and Drama</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your sister, uncover the origin of the Plushes, and survive the chaos. And if you can't, die gloriously or with a padding polyester<strong> </strong>on your face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/6ca02699e3c048a69d2977fcfdf1a74e.poster.avif?t=1755248884\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/6ca02699e3c048a69d2977fcfdf1a74e.webm?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/6ca02699e3c048a69d2977fcfdf1a74e.mp4?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plushes as loot, consumables, and tactical resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental combos: freeze, blow up, clear the path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of multi-layered locations filled with secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon defeated bosses to fight by your side</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The world has been overrun by Plushes</strong><br>Yes, that\u2019s right\u00a0<strong>\u2013</strong> plushy creatures. Cute, soft and completely insane!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are a</strong> <strong>Plush Fighter</strong><br>A young hero with a gun and a shovel.\u00a0Save Moscow from the disaster and find your sister!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way through a city full of mysteries, use the Plushes themselves as weapons, resources, and tools, steal powers from bosses, and unlock access to new areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore, fight, adapt!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cute, but Deadly</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Plush has its own logic and behavior. Study them and turn their features to your advantage! They scream, jump, roll, shove, spit, explode, and cause you endless trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t trust those adorable button eyes<strong>. </strong>Plushes have already destroyed half the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/bce5b3a5c0a16c4f7050ac63377ad8cc.poster.avif?t=1755248884\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/bce5b3a5c0a16c4f7050ac63377ad8cc.webm?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/bce5b3a5c0a16c4f7050ac63377ad8cc.mp4?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Enemy\u2019s Power Is Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat bosses and claim their abilities. Summon giant Plushes as allies in battle. Freeze, burn, crush!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/4ef1c4faf4e46be642f5f63e9a4b86ae.poster.avif?t=1755248884\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/4ef1c4faf4e46be642f5f63e9a4b86ae.webm?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/4ef1c4faf4e46be642f5f63e9a4b86ae.mp4?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Plush as a Tool</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use enemy powers to break barriers and reach hidden areas on the map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/2cc7b2941a937474bd9dca7655b818d2.poster.avif?t=1755248884\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/2cc7b2941a937474bd9dca7655b818d2.webm?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/2cc7b2941a937474bd9dca7655b818d2.mp4?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story on the Edge of Trash and Drama</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your sister, uncover the origin of the Plushes, and survive the chaos. And if you can't, die gloriously or with a padding polyester<strong> </strong>on your face!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/6ca02699e3c048a69d2977fcfdf1a74e.poster.avif?t=1755248884\" width=600 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/6ca02699e3c048a69d2977fcfdf1a74e.webm?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3297800/extras/6ca02699e3c048a69d2977fcfdf1a74e.mp4?t=1755248884\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Mechanics</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plushes as loot, consumables, and tactical resources</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental combos: freeze, blow up, clear the path</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration of multi-layered locations filled with secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon defeated bosses to fight by your side</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "An insane first-person action-adventure, where cuteness has gone too far. Plushes have taken over the city, and there\u2019s only one way out. Pick up a gun and your trusty shovel, and become a Plush Fighter! Shoot Plushes and turn enemies against one another!",
